<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en">
<%- include('partials/head', { description: partner.intro }) %>
<body><%- include('partials/header') %><main id="main">
<section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap"><a class="breadcrumb" href="/">Home /</a> <a class="breadcrumb" href="/partners">Technology partners /</a><span class="breadcrumb"> <%= partner.name %></span><div class="page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow"><%= partner.name %> / <%= partner.category %></p><h1><%= partner.headline %></h1></div><div><p class="intro"><%= partner.intro %></p><a class="button partner-hero-cta" href="mailto:rabindra@tslab.in?subject=<%= encodeURIComponent(partner.name + ' solution enquiry') %>">Discuss <%= partner.name %> ↗</a></div></div></div></section>
<section class="wrap section"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">WHAT YOU CAN DO</p><h2><%= partner.summary %></h2></div></div><div class="approach-grid"><% partner.features.forEach((feature,i) => { %><article class="approach-card"><span class="eyebrow">0<%= i+1 %> /</span><h3><%= feature[0] %></h3><p><%= feature[1] %></p></article><% }); %></div><p class="product-scope">Capabilities depend on product, edition, licensing and supported platforms. TS Lab will help confirm the scope for your environment.</p></section>
<section class="portfolio section"><div class="wrap service-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">START WITH YOUR PRIORITIES</p><h2>Is this the right fit<br>for your business?</h2><p>Use these scenarios as a starting point for a conversation with TS Lab.</p></div><div><% partner.uses.forEach((use,i) => { %><div class="partner-use"><span>0<%= i+1 %></span><h3><%= use %></h3></div><% }); %></div></div></section>
<section class="wrap section"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">MAKE AN INFORMED CHOICE</p><h2>Plan around your environment.</h2></div></div><div class="evaluation-panel"><h3>A question worth answering first</h3><p><%= partner.question %></p><div class="approach-grid"><div><h4>Define the requirement</h4><p>Bring your existing tools, user or asset counts, key workflows and priorities.</p></div><div><h4>Agree an evaluation</h4><p>Discuss a demonstration or pilot scope, subject to availability, using scenarios that matter to your team.</p></div><div><h4>Confirm the details</h4><p>Review compatibility, licensing, rollout responsibilities and support before purchase.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="services section"><div class="wrap service-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">YOUR TECHNOLOGY. OUR SUPPORT.</p><h2>From choosing <%= partner.name %><br><em>to putting it to work.</em></h2><p>TS Lab provides solution consulting, deployment support, technical assistance, training and post-sales support. We’ll agree the services your implementation needs.</p></div><div><div class="service-row"><span>01</span><div><h3>Choose with context</h3><p>Discuss your requirements and the right product scope.</p></div></div><div class="service-row"><span>02</span><div><h3>Prepare your rollout</h3><p>Plan implementation, configuration and administrator enablement.</p></div></div><div class="service-row"><span>03</span><div><h3>Keep the conversation going</h3><p>Arrange technical assistance and post-sales support.</p></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="wrap section closing-cta"><div><p class="eyebrow">LET’S TALK ABOUT YOUR NEEDS</p><h2>Explore <%= partner.name %><br>with TS Lab.</h2></div><a class="button" href="mailto:rabindra@tslab.in?subject=<%= encodeURIComponent(partner.name + ' solution enquiry') %>">Start a conversation ↗</a></section>
<section class="wrap vendor-resources"><div><p class="eyebrow">OFFICIAL PRODUCT RESOURCES</p><% partner.sources.forEach(source => { %><a href="<%= source.url %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><%= source.label %> ↗</a><% }); %><p>Product information reviewed 16 November 2026. Vendor materials may change.</p></div><a class="text-link" href="/partners">View all technology partners →</a></section>
</main><%- include('partials/footer') %></body></html>
